<p><em>S</em>(Genesis 1:1) = {י,ה,ל,ו,צ} = Virgo + Aries + Libra + Taurus + <strong>Aquarius</strong>. Virgo, Libra, and Taurus are filled by fast planets in months; but <strong>Aries and Aquarius</strong> are anchored persistently only by the two slowest planets: <strong>Neptune (Aries) and Pluto (Aquarius)</strong>. Sustained legibility demands <strong>Pluto ∈ Aquarius ∧ Neptune ∈ Aries</strong>.</p>
